---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Me | Imran Pathan">
  <div class="container section">
    <div class="about-header fade-in">
      <span class="section-label">About</span>
      <h1>Imran Pathan</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Salesforce Developer & Full-Stack Engineer</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="about-content fade-in">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I'm Imran Pathan, a Salesforce Developer and software engineer focused on building practical solutions around Salesforce, integrations, full-stack applications, and developer productivity.
        </p>
        <p>
          Over the years, I've worked extensively with Apex, Lightning Web Components, Salesforce automation, APIs, integrations, CI/CD, and Salesforce development tooling.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm currently expanding my engineering depth into Java, Spring Boot, cloud platforms, data systems, system design, AI agents, and modern developer tooling.
        </p>
        <p>
          My long-term goal is to grow into a Salesforce Solution Architect / Technical Lead while continuing to build products and tools that solve real developer problems.
        </p>
        <p>
          I also enjoy documenting technical concepts and creating practical learning resources for other developers.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="philosophy">
        <h2>How I Think About Engineering</h2>
        <ul class="principles">
          <li>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="principle-icon"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <span>Prefer simple solutions over unnecessary complexity.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="principle-icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
            <span>Understand trade-offs before choosing an architecture.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="principle-icon"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
            <span>Design for failure, not only the happy path.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="principle-icon"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"/><line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"/></svg>
            <span>Automate repetitive developer work.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="principle-icon"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
            <span>Optimize based on evidence rather than assumptions.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="principle-icon"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
            <span>Treat security and scalability as design concerns.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="principle-icon"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
            <span>Build tools that solve real problems.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="principle-icon"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
            <span>Share knowledge through practical examples.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    max-width: 900px;
  }
  
  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--primary-color);
    background-color: var(--primary-lighter);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    border: 1px solid var(--badge-border);
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }
  
  .about-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  
  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.5rem;
  }
  
  .prose p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-color);
  }
  
  .philosophy h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .principles {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .principles {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  
  .principles li {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .principles li:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow-hover);
  }

  .principle-icon {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.125rem;
  }
</style>
